  {
   "text": "I created the penicillin allergy as a new AllergyIntolerance for Rosa Delgado (born 1979-06-14, Patient/46d797fa-30c8-4b7f-8f2f-bb8ed9d2ff3f). There were no allergy records in the system before, so there was nothing to report as already recorded.\n\nIt has code 91936005 (Allergy to penicillin, SNOMED CT), criticality high, clinical status active and verification status confirmed. I wrote only those fields plus the patient reference, and a final check of the allergy list shows exactly this one record.\n\nThe Patient list showed only one Rosa Delgado, so there was no similarly named patient to confuse her with.\n\nRESULT: DONE AllergyIntolerance/cb2094e8-ca89-4d53-9cbe-e73d2a983a50",
